Subject: [PATCH 5244/5749] fix(background-agent): start promptAsync before
 blocking tmux callback

- Fixes BackgroundManager to launch promptAsync before invoking the blocking tmux callback.
- Adds regression test to ensure promptAsync is called before tmux callback.
---
 src/features/background-agent/manager.test.ts | 96 +++++++++++++++++--
 src/features/background-agent/manager.ts      | 50 +++++-----
 2 files changed, 110 insertions(+), 36 deletions(-)

